# Frontend QA

## Running Linter
- Run ESLint: `pnpm lint`

## Type Checking
- Run: `npx tsc --noEmit` (type check only, no build)
- Or use your IDE's TypeScript integration

## Before Committing
- Ensure no TypeScript errors
- Ensure no ESLint warnings/errors
- Test the UI manually in the browser at `http://localhost:3000`
